{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50486","headline":"九八 · 王梵志","name":"九八","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"草屋足风尘，牀无破毡卧。\n客来且唤入，地铺稿荐坐。\n家里元无炭，柳麻且吹火。\n白酒瓦鉢藏，（「藏」，项楚校作「盛」。\n）铛子两脚破。\n鹿脯三四条，石盐五六课。\n（「课」，项楚、蒋绍愚校作「颗」。\n）看客只甯馨，从你痛笑我。\n（案以上六首录自郑振铎本拾遗。\n爲王梵志诗原卷第三卷。\n惜不全。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50486.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50486","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}